  <!-- EN: bread -->
  <VLW_Bread.label>面包</VLW_Bread.label>
  <!-- EN: Bread is prepared from a dough of flour and water, usually by baking. Throughout recorded history it has been a prominent food in large parts of the world and is one of the oldest man-made foods. -->
  <VLW_Bread.description>面包是用面粉和水制成的面团，通常通过烘烤制成。在有记载的历史中，它一直是世界许多地区的主要食物之一，也是最古老的人造食品之一。</VLW_Bread.description>
  <!-- EN: cake -->
  <VLW_Cake.label>蛋糕</VLW_Cake.label>
  <!-- EN: Cake is a form of sweet dessert that is typically baked. In its oldest forms, cakes were modifications of breads; typical cake ingredients are flour, eggs, a liquid and leavening agents, such as baking soda or baking powder.\nCommon additional ingredients and flavourings include cocoa and extracts such as vanilla. -->
  <VLW_Cake.description>蛋糕是一种通常通过烘烤制成的甜点。在最早的形式中，蛋糕是面包的变体；典型的蛋糕原料包括面粉、鸡蛋、液体以及膨松剂，例如小苏打或泡打粉。
常见的其他配料和调味料包括可可粉以及香草精等香精。</VLW_Cake.description>
  <!-- EN: hardtack -->
  <VLW_Hardtack.label>硬饼干</VLW_Hardtack.label>
  <!-- EN: Hardtack is a simple type of biscuit or cracker, made from flour, water, and sometimes salt. While inexpensive and long-lasting, it tastes really bland. Used for sustenance in the absence of perishable foods, commonly during long sea voyages, land migrations, and military campaigns. -->
  <VLW_Hardtack.description>硬饼干是一种简单的饼干或脆饼，由面粉、水和有时还会加入盐制成。虽然价格低廉且保质期长，但味道非常淡。在没有易腐食物的情况下，通常用于维持生计，常见于长途航行、陆地迁徙和军事远征中。</VLW_Hardtack.description>
